{"id": "EUVD-2026-71971", "enisaUuid": "44c66e58-ea8c-371d-9154-d81a6cab91b1", "description": "Axolotl before 0.19.0 contains a remote code execution vulnerability in the multipack patch path where trust_remote_code defaults to None instead of False, causing the security guard to be bypassed. Attackers can execute arbitrary Python code by crafting a malicious Hugging Face model repository selected as base_model, which is loaded with hardcoded trust_remote_code=True during AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained.", "datePublished": "2026-09-05T11:01:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:21:12", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl/pull/3858", "https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl/commit/b62d60b101eea7f32532ee3c0b17c2f2430a9262", "https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl/blob/v0.18.0/src/axolotl/loaders/patch_manager.py#L794-L806", "https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl/blob/v0.18.0/src/axolotl/monkeypatch/multipack.py#L86-L96", "https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl/releases/tag/v0.19.0", "https://github.com/axolotl-ai-cloud/axolotl", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/axolotl-through-0.18.0-remote-code-execution-via-multipack-patching"], "aliases": ["GHSA-57g9-xg4g-rmpp", "CVE-2026-86169"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.94, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0bae00e8-d8b9-3817-ad81-95da11e09c80", "product": {"name": "axolotl", "vendor": {"name": "axolotl-ai-cloud"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.19.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a8f5266b-6675-35c9-a244-09bebe1387d2", "vendor": {"name": "axolotl-ai-cloud"}}], "isExploited": false}